OL,4,CZelensky says Crimean Bridge strikes   
OL,5,C'fair response' as he meets UK's       
OL,6,CStreeting                              
OL,7,GUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky 
OL,8,Ghas justified Kyiv's repeated attacks  
OL,9,Gon a critical bridge linking Russia to 
OL,10,Goccupied Crimea, calling it a "fair    
OL,11,Gresponse" to 109 separate Russian      
OL,12,Gattacks on bridges in Ukraine.         
OL,14,FIn comments to the BBC in Kyiv,        
OL,15,FZelensky said the intense attacks on   
OL,16,FUkraine by Russia that have followed   
OL,17,Fthe strikes on the Crimean Bridge were 
OL,18,Fonly a "signal that Vladimir Putin     
OL,19,Fdoes not want to stop. He wants a      
OL,20,Freason to escalate".                   
